# CyberDefenders - DanaBot Investigation Walkthrough

## Challenge Overview

**Challenge Name:** DanaBot
**Platform:** CyberDefenders
**Difficulty:** Easy

This walkthrough documents the investigation of a DanaBot malware infection using a provided PCAP file.

The objective of this challenge was to analyze network traffic, identify the malicious file used for initial access, analyze the malware behavior, extract the second-stage payload, and collect important Indicators of Compromise (IOCs).

